18:["$","p","2",{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"One generic drug may have several brand names, and patients frequently list both. Duplicate therapy — the same drug taken twice under different names — is a real and common cause of harm, and medication reconciliation is where it is caught."}]
